 дома."},{"id":"1009e64db4af","voice":"de-m","text":"die Nacht."},{"id":"6b5fa4faf641","voice":"de-f","text":"die Nacht."},{"id":"1e1b861ea4ad","voice":"ru","text":"ночь."},{"id":"acfa9c28849c","voice":"de-m","text":"die Nächte."},{"id":"f0eab6b9f316","voice":"de-f","text":"Die Nacht ist kalt."},{"id":"ed9a4f77229a","voice":"ru","text":"Ночь холодная."},{"id":"1f9a00b79de0","voice":"de-m","text":"Guten Morgen!"},{"id":"d810eaf24791","voice":"de-f","text":"Guten Morgen!"},{"id":"4051a06b9f6a","voice":"ru","text":"Доброе утро!"},{"id":"66ee45d913c6","voice":"de-m","text":"Guten Tag!"},{"id":"e77302aa7ab8","voice":"de-f","text":"Guten Tag!"},{"id":"f309a8dd33b3","voice":"ru","text":"Добрый день!"},{"id":"45858990af2b","voice":"de-m","text":"Guten Abend!"},{"id":"fa55898bcac7","voice":"de-f","text":"Guten Abend!"},{"id":"8dd5c63c6a46","voice":"ru","text":"Добрый вечер!"},{"id":"2780bc7f2dc4","voice":"de-m","text":"Gute Nacht!"},{"id":"333428bd5ed2","voice":"de-f","text":"Gute Nacht!"},{"id":"253eb8263704","voice":"ru","text":"Спокойной ночи!"},{"id":"7399cee47e5b","voice":"de-m","text":"Auf Wiedersehen!"},{"id":"09e12e3a7516","voice":"de-f","text":"Auf Wiedersehen!"},{"id":"f33d6c01aa48","voice":"ru","text":"До свидания!"},{"id":"8b696529f1c0","voice":"de-m","text":"Tschüss!"},{"id":"812fe8ddf639","voice":"de-f","text":"Tschüss!"},{"id":"2c641166aec9","voice":"ru","text":"Пока!"},{"id":"0bdeaf4fa264","voice":"de-m","text":"Wie geht es Ihnen?"},{"id":"f08fff549cd5","voice":"de-f","text":"Wie geht es Ihnen?"},{"id":"5870a8d32a17","voice":"ru","text":"Как у вас дела?"},{"id":"18dd0676ed46","voice":"de-m","text":"Danke schön!"},{"id":"7472f9bf57e3","voice":"de-f","text":"Danke schön!"},{"id":"6f70f19e4fbb","voice":"ru","text":"Большое спасибо!"},{"id":"1f985fbc4553","voice":"ru","text":"Вежливое обращение."},{"id":"feed07705ccb","voice":"ru","text":"В немецком языке к незнакомым людям обращаются на «Вы». Это слово."},{"id":"926abc251555","voice":"de-m","text":"Sie."},{"id":"8d4ee3f5c7e5","voice":"ru","text":"К мужчине обращаются."},{"id":"b2cc628e8dd9","voice":"de-m","text":"Herr."},{"id":"d3bab536f3e1","voice":"ru","text":"и фамилия:."},{"id":"75752dfa43f6","voice":"de-m","text":"Herr Müller."},{"id":"819b12939f7d","voice":"ru","text":". К женщине —."},{"id":"202707ffd085","voice":"de-m","text":"Frau."},{"id":"f4f9ae00d4c0","voice":"de-m","text":"Frau Schmidt."},{"id":"173cc16a2517","voice":"ru","text":"Вежливый вопрос «Как у вас дела?» звучит так:."},{"id":"bd14d9b353c8","voice":"ru","text":"Ответ:."},{"id":"7d88636b37ec","voice":"de-m","text":"Danke, gut. Und Ihnen?"},{"id":"4b7dc4d56474","voice":"ru","text":"— «Спасибо, хорошо. А у вас?»."},{"id":"8d532578b667","voice":"ru","text":"С друзьями говорят на «ты»:."},{"id":"ff0a235c6b70","voice":"de-m","text":"Wie geht es dir?"},{"id":"0ee663eb0b92","voice":"ru","text":"Но в магазине, у врача и в учреждениях всегда говорят."},{"id":"57c21f976bb7","voice":"ru","text":"Как вежливо спросить «Как у вас дела?»."},{"id":"e2db9f4e2320","voice":"de-m","text":"Wie heißt du?"},{"id":"b0b7cba873c3","voice":"ru","text":"Как поздороваться с господином Мюллером днём?"},{"id":"154d4420eeed","voice":"de-m","text":"Guten Tag, Herr Müller!"},{"id":"f950c7145cef","voice":"de-m","text":"Gute Nacht, Herr Müller!"},{"id":"f1c9e52931fc","voice":"de-m","text":"Tschüss, Herr Müller!"},{"id":"2f075b52cfc2","voice":"ru","text":"Как вежливо попрощаться?"},{"id":"04e76157b8f3","voice":"de-m","text":"Hallo!"},{"id":"0638db2107ff","voice":"de-m","text":"Danke!"},{"id":"68036a835b28","voice":"ru","text":"Что ответить на вопрос."},{"id":"94aff2773b51","voice":"de-m","text":"Nein, bitte."},{"id":"99582500c746","voice":"ru","text":"Здравствуйте и до свидания."},{"id":"d3d523126b30","voice":"ru","text":"В этом уроке вы научитесь здороваться, прощаться и благодарить."},{"id":"8d5a26763192","voice":"de-m","text":"Guten Morgen, Frau Schmidt!"},{"id":"e5a2d36f19a5","voice":"de-f","text":"Guten Morgen, Herr Müller! Wie geht es Ihnen?"},{"id":"b455f5e68fa4","voice":"ru","text":"Доброе утро, господин Мюллер! Как у вас дела?"},{"id":"948159f3858c","voice":"ru","text":"Спасибо, хорошо. А у вас?"},{"id":"a55317457b68","voice":"de-f","text":"Auch gut, danke."},{"id":"b06e307e3ce7","voice":"ru","text":"Тоже хорошо, спасибо."},{"id":"a070ce039fcf","voice":"de-m","text":"Auf Wiedersehen, Frau Schmidt!"},{"id":"bc9c1d503af6","voice":"ru","text":"До свидания, госпожа Шмидт!"},{"id":"f03b0e36f9e2","voice":"ru","text":"Утро в офисе."},{"id":"88041f6625e8","voice":"ru","text":"Какое сейчас время суток?"},{"id":"53af4c4a8a22","voice":"ru","text":"Утро."},{"id":"ab49d9ca064c","voice":"ru","text":"Вечер."},{"id":"e586b3a041d1","voice":"ru","text":"Ночь."},{"id":"f56f67b7df72","voice":"ru","text":"Как дела у господина Мюллера?"},{"id":"095a5720eedb","voice":"ru","text":"Хорошо."},{"id":"a22f89d8843c","voice":"ru","text":"Плохо."},{"id":"cf05c4f804c3","voice":"ru","text":"Он не ответил."},{"id":"eab169c54d71","voice":"ru","text":"Как зовут женщину?"},{"id":"2ba6932ffd02","voice":"ru","text":"Госпожа Шмидт."},{"id":"f0b6fa1a9934","voice":"ru","text":"Госпожа Мюллер."},{"id":"2611e44f7e93","voice":"ru","text":"Госпожа Вебер."},{"id":"6c6bd65cd7d8","voice":"ru","text":"Знакомство."}]